# groovebook: Afro-Cuban 2 / Measure B, kept because its MT (mid tom) lane was INAUDIBLE on the
# first build. Three A presses walk to the group, RIGHT selects Measure B.
#
# The bug was a mix balance, not a missing trigger: a blanket instrument_level(0.45) hit the SINE
# toms as hard as the NOISE hats, leaving the tom stem 20.5 dB under the mix peak. Per-role levels
# plus a velocity bump for the toms closed it to 9.4 dB. Render with
#   --solo-slot 25    (DK_TOM_LO, where LT and MT both land)
# to check the tom alone if this ever regresses.
tap 15 A
tap 25 A
tap 35 A
tap 50 RIGHT
